{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"text\": \"催逼停下来后，他认出自己舍不得的不是一时舒服，而是曾真心相信过的生活。\",\n      \"key\": \"真心相信过的生活\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他盼着人与人靠近时不用时时防备，珍惜的东西也不必靠争抢才能留住。\",\n      \"key\": \"不用时时防备\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他盼着付出只因喜欢，靠近时不必先防着受伤，也不用反复逞强来证明自己值得被爱、被接纳。\",\n      \"key\": \"付出只因喜欢\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他不肯把这份向往说成软弱或幻想。\",\n      \"key\": \"软弱或幻想\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他先只敢认下这点心愿，后来暂时不问它能不能成、有没有用，也不急着分清它和责任谁更要紧。\",\n      \"key\": \"暂时不问\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他由着自己舍不得，也愿意相信这份向往，压住的委屈和思念浮出来，满足和柔软慢慢回来，疲惫暂时淡了。\",\n      \"key\": \"满足和柔软\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"text\": \"这份满足让他一时不想把心思从这份向往上移开，可他盼的生活还没真正实现。\",\n      \"key\": \"向往上移开\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R31\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-7\"],\n      \"what\": \"局部改写\",\n      \"why\": \"将“舍不得回到现实”改为“不想把心思从这份向往上移开”，避免把隔绝静谧的听感写成仿佛身处现实之外的具体处境，同时保留他暂时沉浸于满足、所盼生活仍未实现这两层意思。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R25\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"删除跨段箭头\",\n      \"why\": \"删去 S02-3→S06-2。S02-3只说明珍惜之物已不能像过去那样自然拥有，没有交代争抢这一机制，不足以直接推出这项具体愿望；正文保留不变。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R26\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"删除跨段箭头\",\n      \"why\": \"删去 S05-4→S06-3。S05-4只能解释他为何不愿再逞强，不能单独推出付出只因喜欢、靠近不预防受伤，以及证明自己值得被爱与接纳这一整组愿望；正文保留不变。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b1c56117-e971-4201-ae48-b64fb68f59ff", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T174138956631Z", "elapsed_seconds": 211.141, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T17:45:10.115704+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "51fe1321d68a2ddc4c7171714f46328886a42c02be3f99754140c16c36acf095", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T174138956631Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "s